    Given a monotone $\gamma$-submodular function $f:2^{V} \rightarrow \mathbb{R}^{\geq 0}$ and a modular cost function $c$, with $\mathcal{O}(n^2)$ oracle calls to $f$, the modified ROI algorithm outputs $\Tilde{S}$ such that
